<title>UK: Denmark sets 100 mln stg three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark sets 100 mln stg three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DENMARK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    22.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.155   PAY DATE    22.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  DENMARK   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
